{%- comment -%}
  Order refund (docs/emails.md): the amount, where it goes and when, in the refund policy's words: to the original
  payment method within 5 to 7 working days (not Shopify's "up to 10 days"). Orders are prepaid or partial COD, so
  there is always an online payment. The cash line shows only when the order has a cash-on-delivery payment (Shopify's
  manual "Cash on Delivery (COD)" gateway): by the policy, that part comes to the customer's UPI ID or bank account.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign yb_cash = false -%}
{%- for yb_t in transactions -%}
  {%- assign yb_gateway = yb_t.gateway_display_name | default: yb_t.gateway | downcase -%}
  {%- if yb_gateway contains 'cash' or yb_gateway contains 'cod' -%}{%- assign yb_cash = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{% capture email_body %}We've refunded <strong>{{ amount | money_with_currency }}</strong> to your original payment method. It usually reaches you in 5 to 7 working days.{% if yb_cash %} Any part you paid in cash on delivery comes to your UPI ID or bank account instead.{% endif %}{% endcapture %}
